# markdown under results/ is written by the analysis scripts rather than by
# hand, an index or a table dumped beside the figure it describes. Anchored and
# scoped, because every document a reader needs sits in the root, docs/, demo/
# or experiments/, and none of those are touched.
/results/**/*.md
